a bridge serializes one function request per Program and lets each decompilation run until it completes or the caller cancels."],"relationship_coverage":{"status":"complete","diagnostics":["Only resolved Ghidra call references are returned; unresolved computed or indirect calls remain unknown, while function classifications distinguish thunks and externals."]},"locations":[],"evidence_links":[]}
